WEBVTT

00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:09.500
So close!

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:11.330
He's human.

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:13.380
For the time being, anyway.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.040
As if! I'm 100% human!

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:18.000
I don't deserve this kind of treatment!

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.460
Better safe than sorry.

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:21.790
You were half-possessed by that Oni.

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:24.000
Who are you people?! What even are Oni?!

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.710
I have no idea what's going on!

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:28.130
You're an outsider with no stake in this.

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:29.500
No, I'm not!

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:33.920
Back then, on the day of the disaster, Oni appeared.

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.710
Someone was fending them off.

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:38.580
But there was nothing I could do...

00:00:39.710 --> 00:00:41.290
You guys fight against Oni, right?

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:42.880
Then let me help!

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:45.880
I can fight now! I can save people!

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:48.000
Not happening.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:48.920
But why?!

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:52.330
You made contact with an especially dangerous Oni.

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:54.000
Its name is Ibara.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:55.500
Ibara?

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:59.080
It inhabited that yoroi suit and
devoured the soul of its user.

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:00.080
Huh?

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:04.630
The last person who wore Ibara met with their doom.

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:06.580
They died?

00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:09.500
Doesn't that mean I'm pretty amazing, then?

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:11.000
Huh?!

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:12.960
I mean, I'm still alive and kicking!

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:14.500
You're a real optimist.

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:16.420
It was just a stroke of luck.

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:17.420
That's right.

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:19.790
You're not likely to survive if you try it again.

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:22.290
Hey, twerp. Can you hear me?

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:24.080
C'mon twerp, I'm talking to you!

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:26.040
Wh-who me?!

00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:27.250
Obviously.

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:28.710
Shh! Keep your mouth shut!

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:31.830
Only you can hear my voice right now.

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:36.130
But why would such a dangerous Oni
go inside a powered suit like that?

00:01:36.330 --> 00:01:38.290
I assume because it wanted to control it.

00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:40.540
But I have no idea what it was doing at the museum.

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.630
Listen twerp, ram yourself against that girl with
everything you got. Drive her right onto the floor!

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:46.920
Then all you gotta do is straddle
and choke her, it'll be a cinch!

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:46.540
Whatever!

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:49.500
We can handle the Oni just fine on our own!

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:51.290
Yeah right, that's impossible.

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:52.000
Huh?!

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:54.040
Don't get full of yourself, jerk!

00:01:54.540 --> 00:01:57.170
What? O-oh, no! I wasn't talking to you...

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:01.170
Those who get possessed by Oni have their souls eaten
and eventually become Oni themselves.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.920
Hurry up and take that weak-ass shrine maiden hostage.

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:03.750
Do it right now!

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:03.210
I don't want to have to kill you.

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:05.500
There's no way that's happening!

00:02:06.380 --> 00:02:08.130
You sure are cocky, kid.

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:11.540
Huh? No! Don't get me wrong! Ibara is a maniac...

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:14.290
Aw hell! You good-for-nothing little brat!

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:14.290
That's what we've been telling you this whole time!

00:02:15.710 --> 00:02:16.580
Shut up!

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:19.290
Do you want a knuckle sandwich?

00:02:19.290 --> 00:02:20.960
No! I'm sorry!

00:02:21.170 --> 00:02:22.630
I'm hearing his voice!

00:02:22.630 --> 00:02:23.170
Huh?

00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:24.630
Ibara is talking to me!

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:26.130
Seriously?

00:02:26.130 --> 00:02:28.630
Dumbass! Why would you tell them?!

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:29.880
It talked...

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:36.790
We can't wait any longer.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:42.540
I will contain the suit.

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:45.290
Otherwise it will take full control of Kakeru.

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:48.580
Hold on, let's not be rash here!

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:50.710
Do something, twerp!

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:52.040
What? Me?!

00:02:56.830 --> 00:03:00.080
Just wait, let's talk this out...

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:07.580
I'll hold on to this crystal.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.580
That's the safest choice.

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:12.830
Kakeru Miwa.

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:15.170
There is no place for you here.

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:44.710
Mou dou demo ii ya tte

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:47.500
Nagedashita kotae

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:52.330
Hakanaku saki hakanaku chiru kurikaeshi

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:55.880
Monotarinai mama de

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:58.790
Sou day by day ayunda

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:01.080
Cry mirai kurai

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:05.080
Mada tsukamenai twilight

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:07.460
Don't lose your way

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:10.630
Yume no himo musunde

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:13.040
Take me so high

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:15.880
Hashiri dasu brand new life

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:18.380
Everything I have in my hand

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:22.040
Nanatsu no iro daite

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:23.920
Go ahead, make my day

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:27.290
Kono te de aragae motto!

00:04:27.290 --> 00:04:29.750
Everything I have in my hand

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:33.540
Risou kibou kaite

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:35.130
I won't let you down

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:38.420
Kono hana sakasete zutto!

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:42.080
Believe myself

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:54.040
<b>United Front</b>

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:06.210
You can take that off now.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:08.830
Jerks.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:11.040
Can you still hear that Oni's voice?

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:13.710
No...

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.880
I want to thank you for saving me.

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:20.210
Please don't feel so duty-bound anymore.

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:23.500
Lady Oka.

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:29.460
I think it's best if you let go of the past
and just start living for yourself.

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:33.130
This is goodbye. Please forget about us.

00:05:47.710 --> 00:05:49.460
<b>GIZZAROG</b>

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:51.250
I'm never gonna be able to forget.

00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:57.330
Oh hey!

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:59.250
I haven't checked out the premiere episode yet!

00:05:58.500 --> 00:05:59.500
<b>SWING FOR</b>

00:05:58.500 --> 00:05:59.500
<b>THE FENCES</b>

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:00.710
I wanted to watch it together!

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:07.080
EPISODE 1: A HERO IS BORN

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:06.000
<b>Episode 1</b>

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:07.500
<b>A Hero is Born</b>

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:09.580
I'll pass.

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:12.000
What?! But you've been so hyped for it!

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:15.000
I'm just not in the mood.

00:06:15.420 --> 00:06:16.330
But dude!

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:20.000
I thought you were head over heels!

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:22.830
Oh come on. There's no way.

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:25.330
Actually, maybe that is the case...

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:27.750
No, there's more to it than that.

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:30.830
What's up? Something bothering you?

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:37.130
It's someone I met. They called me worthless.

00:06:37.670 --> 00:06:40.290
Ugh! People who say that are the worst!

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:44.630
They're always like "quit staring" or
"when are you gonna grow up?"

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:46.790
What are you talking about?

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:50.040
I'm trying to say that you shouldn't listen to them.

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:52.830
Yeah, I get that.

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:56.540
I'm getting the sense you want to be left alone.

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:58.710
Not really.

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:00.330
Okay then.

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:01.880
Oh!

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:03.920
I know! Check this out, dude!

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:06.040
What is it this time?

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:09.420
All you can eat fried chicken! Eat 100 of 'em and it's
totally free!

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:10.920
Big whoop.

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:12.580
I'm not done yet! How about this!

00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:17.330
"Freaky chain of events strikes the subway!
Has a portal to hell opened?!" Check it out!

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:18.540
Isn't this nuts?!

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:24.080
Apparently, all of the eye-witnesses are women...

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:27.170
Aw man! That means we can't even see it!

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:29.170
Dullsville!

00:07:31.670 --> 00:07:34.540
<b>Freaky chain of events strikes the subway!</b>

00:07:31.670 --> 00:07:34.540
<b>Has a portal to hell opened?!</b>

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:33.420
Freaky events...

00:07:38.210 --> 00:07:39.130
That's the one.

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:48.210
Whoa! The princess is already here! That never happens!

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:49.790
I actually got here first!

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:51.960
Have you gotten used to your smartphone?

00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:55.250
Yep and now I can look at cute koalas all the time!

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:57.250
That's big progress!

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:58.630
Adorable!

00:07:58.630 --> 00:08:01.040
But for some reason they won't move...

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:02.670
Enough chit-chat.

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:04.920
There's work to do.

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:08.670
What's got Ryo so worked up?

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:11.290
Probably all those surprises from the other day.

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:14.290
Things worked out in the end,
so what's there to worry about?

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:15.710
Stay on your guard.

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:19.000
When you spot an Oni, don't rush in on your own.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:20.250
We attack them together.

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:21.880
Yes sir!

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:24.290
An Oni that only targets women.

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:25.830
Maybe it's...

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:30.960
Please don't be reckless.

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:32.380
Right.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:44.250
Mist?

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:45.830
Way down here?

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:47.540
Incoming.

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:54.670
Kaede!

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:55.380
On it!

00:09:02.920 --> 00:09:03.960
Nice one!

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:06.670
Stay focused. We're not done yet.

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:10.880
No more. I'm done!

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:12.670
What now?

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:17.880
I can't get a job. It's absolutely hopeless!

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:20.040
She's been possessed!

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:24.460
Not on my watch!

00:09:52.630 --> 00:09:53.880
Is that lady okay?

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:55.750
Yes, but...

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:02.710
Get back here!

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:03.380
Ryo!

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:04.710
Let's follow him!

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:05.540
Right!

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:12.290
They're gone...

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:15.210
What was all that talk about not rushing in?!

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:21.630
Quit wasting my time!

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:24.330
Stand aside!

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:30.380
Huh? What happened?

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:31.580
Are you okay?

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:34.580
O-oh gosh, I'm sorry!

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:37.830
That's weird. I can't remember what I was doing.

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:41.920
I saw you fall over suddenly.
You may have had a dizzy spell.

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:45.290
I appreciate your help so much!

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:47.540
Let me do something to thank you!

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:49.420
Where'd she go?

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:52.540
No luck. We can't find Ryo anywhere.

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:56.380
It just goes in circles. We always end up back here.

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:04.330
Nothing. I sense their presence, though...

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:07.290
The Oni's numbers always grow larger with time.

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:08.500
This could be bad...

00:11:09.130 --> 00:11:10.630
Let's go look for him again.

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:11.710
Okay.

00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:23.540
Please... I'm begging you!

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:27.420
What?

00:11:27.630 --> 00:11:29.960
Finally feel like letting me go, huh?

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:31.750
What is this?

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.130
I want you to help us!

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:35.790
That's never going to happen.

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:36.630
What's up?

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:37.670
Huh?

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:39.130
Well, uh...

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:42.040
I recognize them. This is Oka and Ibara talking.

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:44.880
You want me to find an Oni?

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:46.250
Ryo is in trouble.

00:11:46.670 --> 00:11:49.210
Hah! As if I give a damn.

00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:50.540
But he's going to die!

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:53.170
Makes no difference to me.

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:56.170
Somebody's grumpy.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:00.960
Shikizakura!

00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:05.920
Shikizakura!

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:09.960
Ugh, enough! Just shut up!

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:13.380
You're the one making all the noise!

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:15.540
What's going on, dude?

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:18.750
This may sound weird, but it's just hypothetical...

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:22.130
What if the person who called me
worthless was in trouble?

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:25.290
And it turns out I might be able to save them?

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:29.130
I'm not sure I want to. It kinda serves them right.

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:31.500
Totally episode 33.

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:33.580
Huh? Of what?

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:37.170
There's obviously only one episode 33
that should come to mind.

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:38.540
That doesn't narrow it down for me.

00:12:38.830 --> 00:12:41.710
You know, the ep where the hero
loses his faith in humanity

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:45.420
and nearly abandons all the people
who come to him for help.

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:47.250
Sounds pretty dramatic!

00:12:47.670 --> 00:12:50.040
But heroes should never stoop that low...

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:55.290
After episode 33 aired, the director
and scriptwriter were both let go.

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:56.630
Huh?

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:59.170
But Mr. Uehara stuck to his principles despite it all!

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:00.540
Who?

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:04.790
It's an important and necessary theme to explore,
but in the end, the hero can't abandon anyone.

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.420
There's a part where a monk shows up.

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:11.460
I mean, that's what he looks like, but my theory is that
it's an illusion. Or rather, the hero's heart given form.

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:13.290
I'm not following you.

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:15.750
Kakeru! Don't you get it?

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:17.830
Sorry, I'm totally lost.

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:21.500
Just forget about approaching this with logic!

00:13:21.790 --> 00:13:24.830
Look into your heart! And ask it for the answer!

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:27.540
My heart...

00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:29.960
I can't resist any more!

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:32.130
Let's watch it! Episode 33!

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:32.630
<b>VIDEOS</b>

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:37.420
Wait. Where are you going, Kakeru?

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:40.790
Aren't we gonna watch ep 33?!

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:44.380
I'm such an idiot!

00:13:45.210 --> 00:13:47.420
I had already made up my mind!

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:54.420
I'm not the helpless boy I was back then!

00:13:54.920 --> 00:14:00.080
Or obtain real power and graduate from being
the worthless, weak piece of shit you are now.

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:02.420
Go on... choose!

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:05.630
Salvation! Or power!

00:14:06.750 --> 00:14:08.000
I want power!

00:14:13.170 --> 00:14:15.460
I'm gonna use this power to save people!

00:14:17.420 --> 00:14:20.000
The last person who wore Ibara met with their doom.

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:23.170
That doesn't matter! I still have to help!

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:27.250
<b>Obara: The Path to Recovery</b>

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:27.250
<b>The Lone Survivor</b>

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:29.040
I won't hesitate.

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:32.500
I've already... MADE MY CHOICE!

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:38.250
Please!

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:39.920
Screw you!

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:42.880
Listen, I'm an Oni.

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:45.330
If you want my help, you gotta let me eat someone.

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:47.540
I can't do that in good conscience.

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:48.920
But...

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:51.790
Oh please, spare me the theatrics.

00:14:52.130 --> 00:14:55.290
Seriously. You humans are so rotten,
it makes me want to puke.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:56.880
What the?

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:59.790
Thanks for cluing me in, Ibara.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.290
Well, lookie here.

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:03.880
Kakeru?! Why did you come?

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:06.830
Because I can hear every word that comes outta this guy.

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:10.790
This saves me the hassle of finding
another body to take over!

00:15:11.290 --> 00:15:14.710
Ibara! There are Oni nearby. You can find them, right?

00:15:15.170 --> 00:15:19.290
Wait. Are you planning to help that stupid four-eyes?

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:21.330
Then let me have control of your body!

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:24.460
Listen, Kakeru! You can't surrender yourself to him!

00:15:25.630 --> 00:15:28.330
Coming to the rescue is what heroes are all about, right?

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:30.080
This isn't some game.

00:15:30.460 --> 00:15:32.170
Using Ibara will cost you...

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:34.130
I know it's not a game.

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:35.630
I mean business.

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:37.250
I've made up my mind!

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:40.830
Princess!

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:43.290
It's that kid...

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:46.790
Kakeru?!

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:48.710
Please go after him!

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:02.080
Die already!

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:17.170
It's you...

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:18.960
Why are you here?

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:20.170
Because I'm a hero.

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:23.710
So... you're still going on about that crap?

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:28.040
Reject me all you want.
But being a hero is my choice to make.

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:30.040
That bracelet...!

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:34.040
C'mon, release me already.
I'll give you all the power you want!

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:36.790
Don't do it! You'll die!

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:37.750
I'll survive.

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:39.330
He's not gonna eat my soul.

00:16:39.880 --> 00:16:40.670
Huh?

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:45.040
Because... I have faith in myself.
I'm going to become a hero!

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.880
Not on your life, kid.

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:51.040
Okay. Then I guess you're cool
with being a bracelet forever?

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:53.710
Are you trying to threaten me...?

00:16:54.210 --> 00:16:57.170
Ibara! There's only two ways out of this!

00:16:57.630 --> 00:17:00.000
You stay helpless and get
trapped in a cellar somewhere.

00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:02.420
Or you shape up and join forces with me.

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:04.130
So choose!

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:09.000
Now we're talking!
Those are some massive balls you've got, kid!

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:11.000
Kakeru!

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:13.880
Is that what I think it is?

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:16.540
Transform!

00:17:39.630 --> 00:17:40.670
He pulled it off!

00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:58.040
I don't believe it.

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:01.250
Glad I wasn't too late!

00:18:01.250 --> 00:18:03.920
You better thank the twerp, four-eyes.

00:18:04.250 --> 00:18:05.960
"Four-eyes"?

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:08.040
Kakeru!

00:18:10.210 --> 00:18:12.080
Are you really in control right now?

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:13.960
Yep! It's all me!

00:18:15.580 --> 00:18:16.630
Way to go!

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:18.420
The suit looks different from before.

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:26.380
Come on, Ibara!

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:27.830
Hell yeah, time for round 2!

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:30.380
Let's get it on!

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:43.080
Keep up, four-eyes!

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:44.000
Don't order me around!

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:03.830
It wasn't this one...

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:07.960
I'll seal the nether realm shut.

00:19:08.420 --> 00:19:10.920
Leave here and return from whence you came.

00:19:27.130 --> 00:19:28.130
It's back to normal!

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:41.460
I could definitely get used to this!

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:43.290
He's human.

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:45.710
Jeez, quit undressing her with your eyes.

00:19:45.710 --> 00:19:47.330
Dude! Shut up!

00:19:48.210 --> 00:19:50.920
Wow, thanks a lot.

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:53.000
I'll take a bottle of Royal Top!

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:54.380
I'll have some oolong tea.

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:56.170
Go get it yourself.

00:19:56.830 --> 00:19:57.960
Lame!

00:19:57.960 --> 00:19:59.880
We deserve it just as much as Miwa.

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:01.380
What she said!

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:02.790
Whoa! This is good shit!

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:04.170
It's just some soda.

00:20:05.130 --> 00:20:06.290
Kakeru Miwa.

00:20:07.460 --> 00:20:11.210
If you ever prove unable to hold Ibara back,
I will cut you down.

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:13.880
Sure!

00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:16.580
I take it that means you're okay with him using the suit.

00:20:17.250 --> 00:20:18.830
That's a roundabout way of saying it.

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:22.500
Let me guess, you're hunting for a certain Oni.

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:23.130
Huh?

00:20:23.130 --> 00:20:24.790
I was talking to four-eyes.

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:28.250
That's none of your business.

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:33.330
You could show a little more respect
considering I saved your ass!

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:34.000
Hey!

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:36.130
I never asked for your help in the first place.

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:38.540
What a load of crap!

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:47.460
Ima kono shunkan ga owaranai you ni

00:20:47.920 --> 00:20:51.710
Nan juu nen saki made tsuzukimasu you ni

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:57.880
Kirei na fuku datte kirenaku natte

00:20:58.580 --> 00:21:02.380
Watashi dake ga inakunatta sekai de

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:06.710
Ano hi nigate datta cider

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:08.830
Kieta semi no koe

00:21:09.170 --> 00:21:11.210
Unmei ni shizundeku

00:21:11.210 --> 00:21:14.290
Mogaki kata mo wakarazu ni

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:19.130
Watashi no koto nante mietenai mitai de

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:22.960
Sakarau ki mo okinainda yo

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:28.790
Anata ga te o hiite kureta toki

00:21:29.420 --> 00:21:32.710
Mieta kirei na sekai no iro

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:35.210
Sakura no saku kisetsu ni

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:39.330
Mujaki ni warau sore ni tsurarete

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:43.500
Kawaranai koto nante nai

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:47.330
Kanashii mirai datte kitto sou desho

00:22:16.830 --> 00:22:19.080
Wish I knew where Kakeru went off to.

00:22:19.080 --> 00:22:20.250
Are you sure?

00:22:20.880 --> 00:22:24.170
Yes! Of course! Thank you so much!

00:22:28.170 --> 00:22:29.880
I got the job!

00:22:32.380 --> 00:22:34.710
Lot of crows around lately.

00:22:36.630 --> 00:22:40.040
Hey Kaede! Would you like a snack,
or a bottle of Royal Top?

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:41.710
Or maybe, you'd like... me?

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:43.040
Gotta be Royal Top!

00:22:43.540 --> 00:22:45.330
No way, I'm shook!

00:22:45.670 --> 00:22:46.880
Next episode:

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:51.040
<b>Flight</b>

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:47.710
"Flight"

00:22:48.080 --> 00:22:50.790
Maybe I should've chosen the snack instead...
